    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Attendance/ class participation: 20%&nbsp; (Please remember that it is the instructor&rsquo;s duty to roll-call.&nbsp; Roll-calling will be conducted by asking the attendees to sign on a particular sheet of paper during every class meeting.&nbsp; Those who do not skip any class in this course will get a five-point bonus for the final grade.&nbsp; Meanwhile, those who skip as many as fifteen classes will definitely be flunked.&nbsp; Tardiness does not equal absence, but it is unwelcome, nor is early exiting.&nbsp; Please come to class on time, and leave only after the class is dismissed.)</div>\n\n<div>Assignments: 50% /&nbsp; Peer-editing: 5%/ &nbsp;Oral presentation: 25%/</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "1. Don't forget that you're a college student.  Please show respect to your fellow students and the instructor during class meeting, and be sure to turn your smartphones into muted mode. \n2.For each translation assignments, there should be three drafts.  The second draft would not be viewed as complete without the feedback of the peer-editor.\n3. Only by preparing in advance may coursework become easier.",
